WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.631
Your token is listed.

00:00:01.631 --> 00:00:03.660
But can you prove its liquidity?

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:11.570
WATAM measures every verified exchange order book and your token's on-chain pools, within one and two percent of the price.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:23.123
The Listing Liquidity Dossier: order sizes from one thousand to five hundred thousand dollars, Turkish venues, a market-maker KPI check, and the seven-day record.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.160
As PDF and CSV.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:25.657
Black November.

00:00:25.657 --> 00:00:27.798
Seven hundred fifty dollars.

00:00:27.798 --> 00:00:29.022
Now ninety-nine.

00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:31.635
Offer ends November thirtieth.

00:00:31.635 --> 00:00:33.068
WATAM Intelligence.

